  "title": "Cottage Pudding - Upside Down Cake",
  "description": "This is my husband's favorite. I first made it over thirty years ago. You can use canned peaches or pineapple in place of the sliced apples.",
  "authors": [
    "Sandra"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-12-30T04:37:07-05:00",
